  "src": "four colored same-length frame bars and a separate same-size foreground mask bbox",
  "transform": "compact the bars into the output border; place the normalized mask inside it; recolor each mask pixel by the color of its unique nearest border side, leaving tied pixels as the mask color",
  "grid_shape": "n+2 by n+2, where n is the side-bar length and mask bbox size"
}
</annotation>
<generation_spec>
```yaml
